    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96848" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιπτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, prop., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>trodden down</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιπτὴ
				φυλλάς</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιβάς</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				33
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. γέροντες</span>
			<i>tough, sturdy</i> old fellows, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				180
			</span></i> (perh. with allusion to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιπτοὶ
				ἄνθρακες</span>, <i>hard</i> charcoal, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				37
			</span></i>). (In some codd. of <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στειπτός</span>, as also
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ-στειπτος</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ-στιπτος</span>.)</div>
